<title>USA: Fed said to be buying coupons -- market sources.</title>
<headline>Fed said to be buying coupons -- market sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve was seen buying coupons in the money market from August 15, 2002 to February 15, 2027 for delivery on Monday, market sources said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
